      "body": "## Purpose\n\nDeclare the pipeline-stage broadcast tensor as a weight-derived buffer for DeepSeek V4 NVIDIA and V4.1 NVIDIA/AMD. Recompute it from the final hc_attn_fn after reload while preserving storage identity. Track applicability explicitly so stages that do not use the optimization remain disabled. Adds repeated-reload coverage for active and inactive stages.\n\n## Merge order\n\nMerge #53509 first. This branch starts directly from main and contains only this migration; it contains no prerequisite PR commits and is not stacked. Rebase onto main after the core merges before running integration CI.\n\nTracks #57895; ports the relevant portion of aoshen02/vllm#56.\n\n## Validation\n\nRuff formatting and lint checked locally. Linux/GPU integration and CUDA Graph replay validation are pending; local Windows pytest cannot collect because uvloop is unavailable. No H20 run was requested.\n\n## AI disclosure\n\nImplementation and PR text prepared with AI assistance. Human review is pending; this PR is intentionally a draft.",
